; The app's one Theme: the Thai guide font as the default font, and buttons as
; white rounded cards rather than Godot's default grey slabs.
;
; Every screen the child touches uses this — the menus, the character grid and
; the tracing scene — so a button looks and behaves the same wherever it is
; found. It lives here rather than being a sub-resource of each scene because
; it was three copies before, drifting apart by a corner radius at a time.
;
; The Stroke Recorder is deliberately not themed: it is an authoring tool for an
; adult, and looking different from the app is a feature there.
;
; Node-level style overrides (the drawing box, the side panel, the score card)
; stay in their scenes — this file is only what is shared.

